> >>   A question: What an earth is the "Christmas-tree monster"?
> Yeah, but what are they like (what do they do to you etc.)? Somehow
> can't quite imagine a monster in relation to christmas trees... :-)

They swish their tinsel, sing "Winter In Bozbarland", and sometimes
they throw cheap things at you.  But most of the time they threaten
to trample down a nice village, only held back by a mysterious glyph
inscribed in the snow.  Getting rid of them is one of the hardest
puzzles in Beyond Zork.  Recommended.

